replies.set_design:
I'll design a cool Space Invaders clone. Let me think about this:

- **Base**: `shooter` — perfect match: player moves, aims at enemies by alignment, hits increment
- **Asset pack**: `space-shooter` v2 — ships, enemies, weapons, asteroids, explosions (literally what this is for)
- **Hook**: Classic descending alien formation with escalating tension and the iconic UFO bonus
- **Presentation**: `space` environment with explosion/metal-sparks effects, laser/impact-metal/explosion-small sounds (proven space combination)

Let me write the design now.<tool_call>
[{
  "tool": "set_design",
  "args": {
    "design": {
      "base": "shooter",
      "objective": "Defend Earth from descending waves of pixel alien invaders and survive five escalating waves",
      "features": [
        "Player ship anchored at the bottom of the screen moves left and right with Arrow keys or A/D and fires upward with SPACE, with a single player bullet on screen at a time",
        "Five rows of alien invaders in three distinct sprite types form a 10-column grid that marches side to side and steps down one row whenever the formation hits the screen edge",
        "Aliens randomly fire red plasma projectiles downward at increasing frequency as the formation shrinks, and the player must dodge them",
        "Four destructible shield bunkers sit between the player and the aliens; both player shots and alien shots erode them chunk by chunk",
        "A bonus UFO flies across the top of the screen at irregular intervals and awards bonus points when shot",
        "Difficulty scales dynamically: surviving aliens move faster each time one is destroyed, and the marching tempo quickens with each completed wave",
        "Wave progression: clearing all aliens respawns a tighter starting formation one row lower, advancing the wave counter and preserving score",
        "Player starts with three lives and earns an extra life at 5000 points; the game ends when all lives are lost or the alien formation reaches the bunker line",
        "Every destroyed alien triggers a small explosion sprite plus a laser shot sound, hit feedback, and a subtle screen shake on player damage",
        "Animated parallax starfield scrolls behind the play field for atmosphere, with brighter near stars and dimmer far stars",
        "Compact HUD along the top shows current score, high score, current wave number, remaining lives, and a bonus UFO indicator",
        "Victory screen after surviving wave 5 with final score and restart option; defeat screen on loss with restart option"
      ],
      "stages": [
        "Waves 1 to 2: Wide 5-row formation marches slowly, few alien shots and no UFO pressure to teach movement and timing",
        "Waves 3 to 4: Faster march tempo, denser alien fire, UFO appears every 20 to 25 seconds and shield bunkers erode faster",
        "Wave 5: Tightest starting formation near the bunker line, maximum fire rate, last stand for victory"
      ],
      "presentation": {
        "environment": "space",
        "effects": [
          "explosion",
          "metal-sparks"
        ],
        "quality": "auto",
        "sounds": [
          {
            "event": "shot",
            "sound": "laser"
          },
          {
            "event": "hit",
            "sound": "impact-metal"
          },
          {
            "event": "death",
            "sound": "explosion-small"
          }
        ]
      },
      "mechanics": {
        "outcomes": [
          "won",
          "lost"
        ],
        "lives": 3
      },
      "assets": [
        {
          "pack": "space-shooter",
          "version": "2",
          "role": "player_ship",
          "description": "Animated player spaceship with idle and thrust poses"
        },
        {
          "pack": "space-shooter",
          "version": "2",
          "role": "aliens",
          "description": "Three classes of alien invaders with two-frame march and death poses"
        },
        {
          "pack": "space-shooter",
          "version": "2",
          "role": "projectiles",
          "description": "Player laser bolt and alien plasma shot sprites"
        },
        {
          "pack": "space-shooter",
          "version": "2",
          "role": "explosions",
          "description": "Two explosion sequences reused for alien kills and player death"
        },
        {
          "pack": "space-shooter",
          "version": "2",
          "role": "ufo",
          "description": "Bonus mystery UFO sprite that crosses the top of the screen"
        }
      ]
    }
